One player is the defender, determined as normal (see Attackers and Defenders in the 'Chaos on the Streets' article), representing the warband that reached the workshop first. The defender is deployed first, inside or within 6" of the objective building. Then the attacking warband is set up as normal. In addition, for each attacking warband beyond the first, the defender rolls once on the table below to determine the additional equipment his warband gets to start with. Each item may only be found once. If the same number is rolled more than once, re-roll. These items represent the findings of the warband thus far and are meant to give the warband a chance against multiple opponents.

